T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Make sure the LiDAR is configured to stream packets to your host IP.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The repo already includes a sample file:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(/home/melodse/ef_ws/g1/scripts/navigation/slam/mid360_config.json) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Current sample contents:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
("MID360": {) Tj
T*
("lidar_net_info": {) Tj
T*
("cmd_data_port": 56100,) Tj
T*
("push_msg_port": 56200,) Tj
T*
("point_data_port": 56300,) Tj
T*
("imu_data_port": 56400,) Tj
T*
("log_data_port": 56500) Tj
T*
(},) Tj
T*
("host_net_info": [) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
("host_ip": "192.168.123.222",) Tj
T*
("multicast_ip": "224.1.1.5",) Tj
T*
("cmd_data_port": 56101,) Tj
T*
("push_msg_port": 56201,) Tj
T*
("point_data_port": 56301,) Tj
T*
("imu_data_port": 56401,) Tj
T*
("log_data_port": 56501) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(]) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If your PC uses a different address, update host_ip and any related host-side IP fields in) Tj
T*
(the configuration you actually launch with.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 6. Verify Firewall and UDP Ports) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prevent the host from dropping Livox packet traffic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Allow UDP ports 56100 through 56500 used by the MID-360 config.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- If SDK packet flow stalls, the local docs also suggest checking broader UDP ranges) Tj
T*
(  55000-56000 and 7500-7510.) Tj
ET
