() Tj
T*
(Step 7. Test Raw Packet Arrival) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Confirm that the LiDAR is actually sending UDP data to the host.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(sudo tcpdump -i <your_nic> udp port 56300 -n -c 5) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Expected result: you see UDP packets arriving from the MID-360 path.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 8. Run the Python Live Viewer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bring up a direct point-cloud preview before attempting SLAM.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Activate the Python environment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Change into the Livox SLAM area if the config file is expected there.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Run the viewer script.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(cd /home/melodse/ef_ws/g1) Tj
T*
(source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
T*
(cd scripts/navigation/slam) Tj
T*
(python3 ../../sensors/live_points.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important runtime behavior from the code:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The viewer prefers SDK2 and falls back to SDK1 if SDK2 is unavailable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The default mount mode is LIVOX_MOUNT=upside_down.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The viewer keeps a short ring buffer to reduce flicker.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Expected result: an Open3D window appears and shows a live point cloud.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 9. Fix Mount Orientation If the Cloud Looks Inverted) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Correct the point cloud if the LiDAR is not mounted in the repos default orientation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(export LIVOX_MOUNT=normal) Tj
T*
(python3 ../../sensors/live_points.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use normal if your sensor is right-side up. The default in the scripts is upside_down.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 10. Run the Local SLAM Demo) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
ET
endstream
