() Tj
T*
(Feed Livox frames into KISS-ICP and visualize pose plus accumulated map.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(cd /home/melodse/ef_ws/g1) Tj
T*
(source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
T*
(cd scripts/navigation/slam) Tj
T*
(python3 live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Outdoor mode:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIVOX_PRESET=outdoor python3 live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Expected result: a live map window opens and grows as the sensor moves.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 11. Apply Fixed Tilt Compensation If Needed) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Correct scans when the LiDAR is mounted with a known fixed tilt.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LIDAR_TILT_DEG=15 LIDAR_TILT_AXIS=y python3 live_slam.py) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Supported axes are x, y, and z. The script applies the inverse correction automatically.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 12. Understand the Main SLAM Presets) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Choose the right preset before changing lower-level parameters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ParameterIndoorOutdoor) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(frame_time0.35 s0.20 s) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(frame_packets200120) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(voxel_size0.4 m1.0 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(max_range30 m120 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(downsample_limit5,000,0003,000,000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(min_motion0.03 m0.10 m) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(conv_criterion5e-51e-4) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(max_iters800500) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
