() Tj
T*
(Confirm that the ROS driver is publishing point clouds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(rostopic hz /livox/lidar) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Expected result: roughly 10 Hz according to the local quick-start guide.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step 17. Troubleshoot Common Failures) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use the shortest path to isolate the failure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- No ping response: recheck cable, NIC selection, and subnet assignment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- No UDP packets in tcpdump: recheck LiDAR config, firewall, and physical link.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- SDK shared library not found: reinstall SDK2 or set LIVOX_SDK2_LIB or LIVOX_SDK2_DIR.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Viewer opens but looks empty: zoom out or reset the camera.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Cloud is upside down: set LIVOX_MOUNT=normal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- SLAM script exits on KISS-ICP import: install or upgrade kiss-icp.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- ROS bind failed: your host IP in the JSON is wrong or the ports are busy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Cannot import rospy: source the ROS setup files before launching the driver.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
